{"seq":4,"slug":"code-review-practices","title":"Code Review 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/code-quality/code-review-practices","wordCount":520,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"code-review-实践\">Code Review 实践</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Code Review 不仅仅是&quot;找 bug&quot;——它是知识共享、架构守护和团队文化建设的综合实践。自动化工具能够发现格式问题和类型错误，但架构合理性、业务逻辑正确性和代码可维护性的判断，仍然需要人的参与。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    CR[Code Review]&#10;    CR --&gt; QUALITY[质量保障&lt;br/&gt;发现逻辑错误和设计问题]&#10;    CR --&gt; KNOWLEDGE[知识共享&lt;br/&gt;团队成员互相学习]&#10;    CR --&gt; GUARD[架构守护&lt;br/&gt;确保一致的架构决策]&#10;    CR --&gt; CULTURE[文化建设&lt;br/&gt;建立共同的工程标准]\">graph TD\n    CR[Code Review]\n    CR --&gt; QUALITY[质量保障&lt;br/&gt;发现逻辑错误和设计问题]\n    CR --&gt; KNOWLEDGE[知识共享&lt;br/&gt;团队成员互相学习]\n    CR --&gt; GUARD[架构守护&lt;br/&gt;确保一致的架构决策]\n    CR --&gt; CULTURE[文化建设&lt;br/&gt;建立共同的工程标准]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"review-流程设计\">Review 流程设计</h2><h3 id=\"pull-request-工作流\">Pull Request 工作流</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    BRANCH[创建 Feature Branch] --&gt; DEVELOP[开发编码]&#10;    DEVELOP --&gt; SELF_REVIEW[自我审查]&#10;    SELF_REVIEW --&gt; PR[创建 PR]&#10;    PR --&gt; AUTO[自动化检查&lt;br/&gt;CI/Lint/Test/Type]&#10;    AUTO --&gt;|通过| ASSIGN[分配 Reviewer]&#10;    AUTO --&gt;|失败| FIX[修复问题]&#10;    FIX --&gt; AUTO&#10;    ASSIGN --&gt; REVIEW[人工 Review]&#10;    REVIEW --&gt;|批准| MERGE[合并代码]&#10;    REVIEW --&gt;|需修改| REVISE[修改代码]&#10;    REVISE --&gt; REVIEW\">flowchart TD\n    BRANCH[创建 Feature Branch] --&gt; DEVELOP[开发编码]\n    DEVELOP --&gt; SELF_REVIEW[自我审查]\n    SELF_REVIEW --&gt; PR[创建 PR]\n    PR --&gt; AUTO[自动化检查&lt;br/&gt;CI/Lint/Test/Type]\n    AUTO --&gt;|通过| ASSIGN[分配 Reviewer]\n    AUTO --&gt;|失败| FIX[修复问题]\n    FIX --&gt; AUTO\n    ASSIGN --&gt; REVIEW[人工 Review]\n    REVIEW --&gt;|批准| MERGE[合并代码]\n    REVIEW --&gt;|需修改| REVISE[修改代码]\n    REVISE --&gt; REVIEW</pre><h3 id=\"pr-模板\">PR 模板</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## 变更描述&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 简要描述本次变更的目的和内容 --&gt;&#10;&#10;## 变更类型&#10;&#10;- [ ] 新功能&#10;- [ ] Bug 修复&#10;- [ ] 重构&#10;- [ ] 性能优化&#10;- [ ] 文档更新&#10;- [ ] 依赖升级&#10;&#10;## 影响范围&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 列出受影响的模块/页面 --&gt;&#10;&#10;## 测试覆盖&#10;&#10;- [ ] 单元测试&#10;- [ ] 集成测试&#10;- [ ] 手动测试&#10;&#10;## 截图/录屏&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- UI 变更时附上前后对比 --&gt;&#10;&#10;## Checklist&#10;&#10;- [ ] 代码已自我审查&#10;- [ ] 类型检查通过&#10;- [ ] 测试通过&#10;- [ ] 文档已更新（如需要）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 变更描述</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 简要描述本次变更的目的和内容 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 变更类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 新功能</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] Bug 修复</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 重构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 性能优化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 文档更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 依赖升级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 影响范围</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 列出受影响的模块/页面 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 测试覆盖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 单元测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 集成测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 手动测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 截图/录屏</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- UI 变更时附上前后对比 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Checklist</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 代码已自我审查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 类型检查通过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 测试通过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ ] 文档已更新（如需要）</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"review-清单\">Review 清单</h2><h3 id=\"架构层面\">架构层面</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ArchitectureChecklist {&#10;  items: string[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;const architectureChecklist: ArchitectureChecklist = {&#10;  items: [&#10;    &#39;变更是否符合项目的目录约定？&#39;,&#10;    &#39;新模块的依赖方向是否正确？（features 不互相依赖）&#39;,&#10;    &#39;是否有可以复用的现有代码？避免重复实现&#39;,&#10;    &#39;新增依赖是否必要？包体积影响如何？&#39;,&#10;    &#39;API 设计是否向后兼容？&#39;,&#10;  ],&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ArchitectureChecklist</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  items</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> architectureChecklist</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ArchitectureChecklist</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  items: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '变更是否符合项目的目录约定？'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '新模块的依赖方向是否正确？（features 不互相依赖）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '是否有可以复用的现有代码？避免重复实现'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '新增依赖是否必要？包体积影响如何？'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'API 设计是否向后兼容？'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"代码层面\">代码层面</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查项</th>\n<th>关注点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>命名清晰度</td>\n<td>变量名、函数名是否准确表达意图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>函数复杂度</td>\n<td>是否可以拆分为更小的函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误处理</td>\n<td>边界情况和异常路径是否覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型安全</td>\n<td>是否存在 <code>any</code>、类型断言是否合理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能影响</td>\n<td>是否有不必要的重渲染、大量计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全风险</td>\n<td>XSS、敏感数据暴露、不安全的第三方依赖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"react-专项\">React 专项</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const reactReviewChecklist = [&#10;  &#39;Hooks 是否在组件顶层调用？条件调用会违反 Hooks 规则&#39;,&#10;  &#39;useEffect 的依赖数组是否完整？&#39;,&#10;  &#39;大型列表是否使用了 key 属性？key 是否稳定？&#39;,&#10;  &#39;是否存在不必要的 state？能否从 props 或其他 state 推导？&#39;,&#10;  &#39;组件是否过大？是否需要拆分？&#39;,&#10;  &#39;memo / useMemo / useCallback 的使用是否有依据？&#39;,&#10;  &#39;事件处理函数是否正确清理？（如 addEventListener）&#39;,&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> reactReviewChecklist</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'Hooks 是否在组件顶层调用？条件调用会违反 Hooks 规则'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'useEffect 的依赖数组是否完整？'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '大型列表是否使用了 key 属性？key 是否稳定？'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '是否存在不必要的 state？能否从 props 或其他 state 推导？'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '组件是否过大？是否需要拆分？'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'memo / useMemo / useCallback 的使用是否有依据？'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '事件处理函数是否正确清理？（如 addEventListener）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"自动化辅助\">自动化辅助</h2><h3 id=\"github-actions-自动化检查\">GitHub Actions 自动化检查</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: PR Checks&#10;on:&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    branches: [main, develop]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  quality:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 20&#10;          cache: &#39;pnpm&#39;&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - run: pnpm run typecheck&#10;      - run: pnpm run lint&#10;      - run: pnpm run test&#10;      - run: pnpm run build&#10;&#10;  bundle-size:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 20&#10;          cache: &#39;pnpm&#39;&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - run: pnpm run build&#10;      - uses: andresz1/size-limit-action@v1&#10;        with:&#10;          github_token: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PR Checks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">develop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  quality</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pnpm'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm run typecheck</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm run lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm run test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm run build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  bundle-size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pnpm'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm run build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">andresz1/size-limit-action@v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          github_token</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"codeowners-自动分配\">CODEOWNERS 自动分配</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# .github/CODEOWNERS&#10;/apps/web/              @frontend-web-team&#10;/apps/admin/            @frontend-admin-team&#10;/packages/ui/           @design-system-team&#10;/packages/shared/       @platform-team&#10;*.sql                   @database-team\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># .github/CODEOWNERS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/apps/web/              @frontend-web-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/apps/admin/            @frontend-admin-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/packages/ui/           @design-system-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/packages/shared/       @platform-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>*.sql                   @database-team</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"review-文化建设\">Review 文化建设</h2><h3 id=\"review-的沟通原则\">Review 的沟通原则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>对事不对人</td>\n<td>Review 的是代码，不是写代码的人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提问而非指令</td>\n<td>&quot;这里是否考虑过边界情况？&quot; &gt; &quot;这里写错了&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>给出理由</td>\n<td>不仅指出问题，还要解释为什么</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区分严重程度</td>\n<td>使用标签区分：<code>blocker</code>、<code>suggestion</code>、<code>nit</code>、<code>question</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>肯定优秀之处</td>\n<td>遇到好的实现主动肯定，鼓励正向行为</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"review-评论标签\">Review 评论标签</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- blocker: 必须修复才能合并 --&gt;&#10;&#10;[blocker] 这里的 API 调用没有错误处理，用户可能看到白屏。&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- suggestion: 建议优化，非阻塞 --&gt;&#10;&#10;[suggestion] 这个逻辑可以用 `Array.prototype.flatMap` 简化。&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- nit: 微小问题，不影响合并 --&gt;&#10;&#10;[nit] 变量名 `d` 建议改为 `data`，更具可读性。&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- question: 纯粹的疑问，寻求理解 --&gt;&#10;&#10;[question] 为什么这里选择了 useRef 而不是 useState？\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- blocker: 必须修复才能合并 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">blocker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] 这里的 API 调用没有错误处理，用户可能看到白屏。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- suggestion: 建议优化，非阻塞 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">suggestion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] 这个逻辑可以用 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`Array.prototype.flatMap`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 简化。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- nit: 微小问题，不影响合并 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">nit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] 变量名 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`d`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 建议改为 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`data`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">，更具可读性。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- question: 纯粹的疑问，寻求理解 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">question</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] 为什么这里选择了 useRef 而不是 useState？</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"review-效率优化\">Review 效率优化</h2><h3 id=\"控制-pr-大小\">控制 PR 大小</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    SMALL[&quot;小 PR&lt;br/&gt;&lt; 200 行&lt;br/&gt;Review 质量高&quot;]&#10;    MEDIUM[&quot;中 PR&lt;br/&gt;200-500 行&lt;br/&gt;需要更多时间&quot;]&#10;    LARGE[&quot;大 PR&lt;br/&gt;&gt; 500 行&lt;br/&gt;容易遗漏问题&quot;]&#10;&#10;    SMALL --&gt;|推荐| MERGE[高效合并]&#10;    MEDIUM --&gt;|可接受| MERGE&#10;    LARGE --&gt;|应拆分| SPLIT[拆分为多个 PR]\">graph LR\n    SMALL[\"小 PR&lt;br/&gt;&lt; 200 行&lt;br/&gt;Review 质量高\"]\n    MEDIUM[\"中 PR&lt;br/&gt;200-500 行&lt;br/&gt;需要更多时间\"]\n    LARGE[\"大 PR&lt;br/&gt;&gt; 500 行&lt;br/&gt;容易遗漏问题\"]\n\n    SMALL --&gt;|推荐| MERGE[高效合并]\n    MEDIUM --&gt;|可接受| MERGE\n    LARGE --&gt;|应拆分| SPLIT[拆分为多个 PR]</pre><h3 id=\"stacked-prs\">Stacked PRs</h3><p>对于大型功能，使用 Stacked PRs 将一个大变更拆分为多个有序的小 PR：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"main&#10; └── feature/user-auth-1-models       (PR #1: 数据模型)&#10;      └── feature/user-auth-2-api     (PR #2: API 层)&#10;           └── feature/user-auth-3-ui (PR #3: UI 层)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span> └── feature/user-auth-1-models       (PR #1: 数据模型)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      └── feature/user-auth-2-api     (PR #2: API 层)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           └── feature/user-auth-3-ui (PR #3: UI 层)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每个 PR 独立 Review、独立合并，大幅降低单次 Review 的认知负担。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Code Review 是质量保障、知识共享、架构守护和文化建设的综合实践。</li>\n<li>PR 模板和 Review 清单让 Review 过程更加结构化、可重复。</li>\n<li>自动化检查（CI、CODEOWNERS、Bundle Size）减少人工 Review 的负担。</li>\n<li>健康的 Review 文化强调&quot;对事不对人&quot;、给出理由、区分严重程度。</li>\n<li>控制 PR 大小（&lt; 200 行最佳）是提升 Review 效率的关键策略。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Code Review 实践","id":"code-review-实践"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Review 流程设计","id":"review-流程设计"},{"level":3,"text":"Pull Request 工作流","id":"pull-request-工作流"},{"level":3,"text":"PR 模板","id":"pr-模板"},{"level":2,"text":"Review 清单","id":"review-清单"},{"level":3,"text":"架构层面","id":"架构层面"},{"level":3,"text":"代码层面","id":"代码层面"},{"level":3,"text":"React 专项","id":"react-专项"},{"level":2,"text":"自动化辅助","id":"自动化辅助"},{"level":3,"text":"GitHub Actions 自动化检查","id":"github-actions-自动化检查"},{"level":3,"text":"CODEOWNERS 自动分配","id":"codeowners-自动分配"},{"level":2,"text":"Review 文化建设","id":"review-文化建设"},{"level":3,"text":"Review 的沟通原则","id":"review-的沟通原则"},{"level":3,"text":"Review 评论标签","id":"review-评论标签"},{"level":2,"text":"Review 效率优化","id":"review-效率优化"},{"level":3,"text":"控制 PR 大小","id":"控制-pr-大小"},{"level":3,"text":"Stacked PRs","id":"stacked-prs"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"类型安全策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/code-quality/type-safety-strategies"},"next":{"title":"单元测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-engineering/testing-strategy/unit-testing"}}